        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manga Ninja is an innovative platform jumping game. In this unique comic book world, you will play as a ninja and embark on a challenging adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061370/extras/17831f7ed3b53d48592b22de26810a27.webp?t=1762397239\" width=760 height=39 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Core Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike traditional jumping games, you <strong><i><u>cannot jump</u></i></strong> directly, but need to use your ninja skills skillfully. By launching shuriken, you can create grappling points in the air, and then quickly launch the grappling hook to the position of the shuriken to achieve thrilling displacement. This unique way of moving will bring you an unprecedented gaming experience.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Throwing Shurikens</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061370/extras/c92c9eadbd7e2cebc7d3f6f520e0a417.poster.avif?t=1762397239\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061370/extras/c92c9eadbd7e2cebc7d3f6f520e0a417.webm?t=1762397239\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061370/extras/c92c9eadbd7e2cebc7d3f6f520e0a417.mp4?t=1762397239\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Launching the Grappling Hook</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061370/extras/d9b7530a48124eb84d8c439d7f78565f.poster.avif?t=1762397239\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061370/extras/d9b7530a48124eb84d8c439d7f78565f.webm?t=1762397239\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061370/extras/d9b7530a48124eb84d8c439d7f78565f.mp4?t=1762397239\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Launching the Grappling Hook</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061370/extras/84c9cdf864f5fc8c5e28f3a9e1690758.poster.avif?t=1762397239\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061370/extras/84c9cdf864f5fc8c5e28f3a9e1690758.webm?t=1762397239\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061370/extras/17831f7ed3b53d48592b22de26810a27.webp?t=1762397239\" width=760 height=39 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Diverse Stages</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will embark on an adventure in various scenes full of Japanese characteristics: ancient dojos, quiet bamboo forests, picturesque canals, and magnificent Japanese castles. Each scene has been carefully designed with a unique visual style, full of challenges and fun.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dojo</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061370/extras/e13b10fe760fd3a1bcf24d1a51c76a50.avif?t=1762397239\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061370/extras_big/e13b10fe760fd3a1bcf24d1a51c76a50.avif?t=1762397239 width=1560 height=794 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bamboo Forest</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061370/extras/1436db5a47379cc828d6427bdbc2d564.avif?t=1762397239\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061370/extras_big/1436db5a47379cc828d6427bdbc2d564.avif?t=1762397239 width=1560 height=920 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Canal</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061370/extras/7b7ebee97e6e6e1b9d45532325797ed8.avif?t=1762397239\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061370/extras_big/7b7ebee97e6e6e1b9d45532325797ed8.avif?t=1762397239 width=1560 height=848 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cave</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061370/extras/e3b520e1db79a426ec2ff66d494744ce.avif?t=1762397239\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061370/extras_big/e3b520e1db79a426ec2ff66d494744ce.avif?t=1762397239 width=1560 height=938 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Castle Rooftop</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061370/extras/164172a36b00022d573202b56c31663a.avif?t=1762397239\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061370/extras_big/164172a36b00022d573202b56c31663a.avif?t=1762397239 width=1560 height=856 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Castle Interior</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061370/extras/cc6f1a32ab186a37a68073f361c071b2.avif?t=1762397239\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061370/extras_big/cc6f1a32ab186a37a68073f361c071b2.avif?t=1762397239 width=1560 height=938 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lantern Festival</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061370/extras/2f759dc4546905e7bfbd5908d33bb0ff.avif?t=1762397239\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061370/extras_big/2f759dc4546905e7bfbd5908d33bb0ff.avif?t=1762397239 width=1560 height=1018 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each of these scenes is framed like panels of a manga. With traps and challenges designed for different environments, the pacing varies from stage to stage, keeping the experience fresh and engaging.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061370/extras/17831f7ed3b53d48592b22de26810a27.webp?t=1762397239\" width=760 height=39 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the Developer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is my very first published game, refined from a small project I made during my undergraduate years. At first, it was just a simple idea, but after letting friends playtest it, their positive feedback gave me the motivation to continue developing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game draws inspiration from <strong>traditional Japanese culture</strong> and the aesthetics of <strong>manga art</strong>, with a design philosophy rooted in Japanese minimalism.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The challenges are intuitive, yet players will find themselves hooked, discovering a true sense of accomplishment as they overcome each panel of this comic-style adventure. I hope you enjoy playing it as much as I enjoyed creating it!</p>",
